{"id":"starukha","lemma":"старуха","pos":"noun","rank":4078,"glosses":["old lady (a close female friend or one's wife; also used as a term of address)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D1%85%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D1%85%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"старухи","plural":"старухи","masculine":"старик"},"examples":[{"text":"Вы злобная старуха.","en":"You're a mean old woman.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,null]},{"text":"Старуха сумасшедшая.","en":"That old lady is crazy.","words":[null,{"g":"mad, crazy","l":"сумасшедший"}]},{"text":"Ты жалкая старуха.","en":"You're a mean old woman.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"pitiable","l":"жалкий"},null]},{"text":"Что это за старик?","en":"Who is that old man?","words":[null,null,{"g":"behind / for"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why"]]},{"text":"Старуха внимательно изучила посетителя.","en":"The old woman studied the visitor carefully.","words":[null,{"g":"attentively, carefully"},{"g":"to learn, to study","l":"изучить"},{"g":"visitor, caller","l":"посетитель"}]}]}